OL,3,CThree people taken to hospital after
OL,4,Ccar crashes into house
OL,6,FThree people have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital after a car crashed into a
OL,8,Fhouse in Sunderland.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called shortly
OL,11,Fafter 5am on Saturday (1 August)
OL,12,Ffollowing reports of a car crashing
OL,13,Finto a property near the junction of
OL,14,FKayll Road and Chester Road.
OL,16,FNorth East Ambulance Service were at
OL,17,Fthe scene, and said: "We dispatched
OL,18,Fthree ambulance crews, a doctor in a
OL,19,Frapid response car, a hazardous area
OL,20,Fresponse team (HART) crew and a
OL,21,Fspecialist paramedic."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/2
