OL,3,CThree people taken to hospital after
OL,4,Ccar crashes into house
OL,6,FOne person, who was unconscious, was
OL,7,Ftaken to the Royal Victoria Infirmary
OL,8,Fin Newcastle. Two others were also
OL,9,Ftaken to hospital.
OL,11,FNorthumbria Police has been contacted
OL,12,Ffor further information about the
OL,13,Fincident.
